# ------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT - Keep these in Git:
# ------------------------------------------
# *.cpp / *.h / *.hpp
# *.sln / *.slnx
# *.vcxproj / *.vcxproj.filters
# CMakeLists.txt / CMakePresets.json
# assets/ (textures, sounds, fonts, shaders)
# include/ (headers)
# lib/ (third-party libraries if required)
# .vsconfig
#
# Do not globally ignore *.lib, *.a,
# *.dll or *.dylib: raylib or other
# dependencies may require these files.
